(7581153, 1218227, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Absolutely stunning scene captured here! Love the golden light. I really like how the light illuminates the field with a warm golden glow. And the absolute best is the sun peeking and rays flaring out from the horses mane! Just beautiful!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Absolutely stunning scene captured here! Love the golden light. I really like how the light illuminates the field with a warm golden glow. And the absolute best is the sun peeking and rays flaring out from the horses mane! Just beautiful!', '2018-07-11 21:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7581154, 1219536, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>This paddleboarder looks like he is gliding on liquid sunlight! His silhouette contrasts beautifully off of the orange-gold waters. Love the ripples in the water as he paddles through small ''islands'' of vegetation! Superb work!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. This paddleboarder looks like he is gliding on liquid sunlight! His silhouette contrasts beautifully off of the orange-gold waters. Love the ripples in the water as he paddles through small ''islands'' of vegetation! Superb work!', '2018-07-11 21:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7581158, 1219468, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to the comment.<br/> <br/>The diffused look of the fading sunlight on this field of daisies creates a soft and dreamy mood. We are daydreaming, zen-ing out to the nice soft breeze as we lay in the field staring at the warm light that bathes the flowers with a glowing outline. Unfazed by the appearance of the wasp we observe it''s setting sun flight across the petals. Wonderfully seen and captured!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to the comment. The diffused look of the fading sunlight on this field of daisies creates a soft and dreamy mood. We are daydreaming, zen-ing out to the nice soft breeze as we lay in the field staring at the warm light that bathes the flowers with a glowing outline. Unfazed by the appearance of the wasp we observe it''s setting sun flight across the petals. Wonderfully seen and captured!', '2018-07-11 22:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7581160, 1218414, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Fantastic silhouette of the egret perched on the curved tree limb that rises out of the water. The crane, tree limb, and their reflections with the contrast off of the blue-white waters. The circular ripples that dance across the surface of the water adds visual interest. Beautiful minimalist nature shot!!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Fantastic silhouette of the egret perched on the curved tree limb that rises out of the water. The crane, tree limb, and their reflections with the contrast off of the blue-white waters. The circular ripples that dance across the surface of the water adds visual interest. Beautiful minimalist nature shot!!', '2018-07-11 22:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7581167, 1219302, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The sun and it''s light bursts between these two boys. Rays of the sun spread out and the boy''s shadows fall upon the sidewalk along. The shadows - it is the shadows that hook and capture my attention! The one boy stretches his one hand between the two of them creating a reaching shadow hand on the ground. Love how that shadow hand is perfectly framed between the two boys shadows that stretch out to the opposite bottom corners of the photo. Excellent work with composing all the main subject to create an compelling and intriguing image! I could very easily see this as a cover of a book.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The sun and it''s light bursts between these two boys. Rays of the sun spread out and the boy''s shadows fall upon the sidewalk along. The shadows - it is the shadows that hook and capture my attention! The one boy stretches his one hand between the two of them creating a reaching shadow hand on the ground. Love how that shadow hand is perfectly framed between the two boys shadows that stretch out to the opposite bottom corners of the photo. Excellent work with composing all the main subject to create an compelling and intriguing image! I could very easily see this as a cover of a book.', '2018-07-11 22:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7581174, 1219557, 124815, '<td valign="top">An absolutely delightful image.</td>', 'An absolutely delightful image.', '2018-07-11 22:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
