(7581202, 1218265, 42013, '<td valign="top">My 10. Beautiful face and lighting. Some may mark you down for too much shadow detail but yours is a great interpretation.</td>', 'My 10. Beautiful face and lighting. Some may mark you down for too much shadow detail but yours is a great interpretation.', '2018-07-12 01:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7581271, 1219478, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the moment caught here at this aquarium! Watching the fish, the manta, and the shark swim by the little girl raises her plush dolphin and imagines that she is there swimming with them. Another child stands just off to the right watching the whole scene play out. I really love this moment capturing the magic of childhood and imagination. There is one small suggestion I have that could strengthen the imagery - crop the bottom 10% as it is just empty negative space that does nothing to contribute to the imagery. It would keep the focus on your main subject which is the girl imagining herself to be the plush dolphin swimming with the rest of the fish.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the moment caught here at this aquarium! Watching the fish, the manta, and the shark swim by the little girl raises her plush dolphin and imagines that she is there swimming with them. Another child stands just off to the right watching the whole scene play out. I really love this moment capturing the magic of childhood and imagination. There is one small suggestion I have that could strengthen the imagery - crop the bottom 10% as it is just empty negative space that does nothing to contribute to the imagery. It would keep the focus on your main subject which is the girl imagining herself to be the plush dolphin swimming with the rest of the fish.', '2018-07-12 11:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7581274, 1219060, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great silhouettes of these two children running and playing. The smaller child looks like they are really mustering all their speed in order to catch/tag the other one. Great action shot! I do think that there is a bit too much negative space with the clouds. Your main subject is the two children playing a game of catch-up so the attention should be keeping them in the spotlight. My suggestion is crop the top 1/3 off and to give it a widescreen movie still look that way it brings more attention to the main subjects. The widescreen view also would keep plenty of the wide open space so that we can clearly imagine these two children could ''keep on running'' across the frame.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great silhouettes of these two children running and playing. The smaller child looks like they are really mustering all their speed in order to catch/tag the other one. Great action shot! I do think that there is a bit too much negative space with the clouds. Your main subject is the two children playing a game of catch-up so the attention should be keeping them in the spotlight. My suggestion is crop the top 1/3 off and to give it a widescreen movie still look that way it brings more attention to the main subjects. The widescreen view also would keep plenty of the wide open space so that we can clearly imagine these two children could ''keep on running'' across the frame.', '2018-07-12 11:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7581276, 1219069, 66384, '<td valign="top">Doesnt seem like contre-jour to me, with the sunshine on his back.</td>', 'Doesnt seem like contre-jour to me, with the sunshine on his back.', '2018-07-12 11:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7581277, 1219458, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Beautiful scenery captured here! Love how the scene is framed by the station''s cabin open doorway! The sun bursts through the opening in the cabin sending rays of sunshine out in a beautiful starburst pattern. The light softly illuminates what is inside the cabin. A dog strolls forward seemingly following the warmth and the light. Love how the light softly illuminates the shape of dog in a soft glow.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Beautiful scenery captured here! Love how the scene is framed by the station''s cabin open doorway! The sun bursts through the opening in the cabin sending rays of sunshine out in a beautiful starburst pattern. The light softly illuminates what is inside the cabin. A dog strolls forward seemingly following the warmth and the light. Love how the light softly illuminates the shape of dog in a soft glow.', '2018-07-12 11:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7581280, 1219464, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the image, but the light seems to be coming from the right rather than toward the camera. Not my idea of contre-jour.</td>', 'Love the image, but the light seems to be coming from the right rather than toward the camera. Not my idea of contre-jour.', '2018-07-12 11:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
