(7581780, 1219386, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I couldn''t help but see this as a recreation of escaping the Hatch from Lost!:-) Regardless it is clever and very well done! Love the pose of the Woody as he makes his climb out of the shaft. His wooden hand peers up at the light, looking to see how much further he must go. I especially love how you have the ''inner seam'' (for lack of a better description) coming out of the left bottom corner and stretching out to the horizon line above - it acts as a wonderful leading line. Superb job!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I couldn''t help but see this as a recreation of escaping the Hatch from Lost!:-) Regardless it is clever and very well done! Love the pose of the Woody as he makes his climb out of the shaft. His wooden hand peers up at the light, looking to see how much further he must go. I especially love how you have the ''inner seam'' (for lack of a better description) coming out of the left bottom corner and stretching out to the horizon line above - it acts as a wonderful leading line. Superb job!', '2018-07-13 22:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7581783, 1219311, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Beautiful colors of blues and golds in this capture. The silhouette of the girl fishing contrasts beautifully off of the serene waters! Love the glow around this young girl as she stands waiting to get a bite on the hook! Another plus is the ripples upon the surface of the water that adds to the visual interest. One small suggestion that could strengthen the composition even more is to crop out the reflection of trees on the water''s surface at the top of the frame as that it does not add to the composition overall. By keeping it minimal the main subjects will fill the frame: the eye will see the girl on the left then follow the leading line of the rod to the top and down the line to the fishing bobber in the water.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Beautiful colors of blues and golds in this capture. The silhouette of the girl fishing contrasts beautifully off of the serene waters! Love the glow around this young girl as she stands waiting to get a bite on the hook! Another plus is the ripples upon the surface of the water that adds to the visual interest. One small suggestion that could strengthen the composition even more is to crop out the reflection of trees on the water''s surface at the top of the frame as that it does not add to the composition overall. By keeping it minimal the main subjects will fill the frame: the eye will see the girl on the left then follow the leading line of the rod to the top and down the line to the fishing bobber in the water.', '2018-07-13 23:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7581786, 1219456, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wonderful framing of the bow of this boat -the low angle gives the impression that it is sailing across the water moving past me! And what a great find on the name of the boat too! Rey is the name of the boat but there is another ray or rather rays here. The sun''s rays burst forth in a star pattern as it peeks out from the bow of the ship. Wonderful lighting, framing of main subject and wordplay here!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wonderful framing of the bow of this boat -the low angle gives the impression that it is sailing across the water moving past me! And what a great find on the name of the boat too! Rey is the name of the boat but there is another ray or rather rays here. The sun''s rays burst forth in a star pattern as it peeks out from the bow of the ship. Wonderful lighting, framing of main subject and wordplay here!', '2018-07-13 23:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7581793, 1218499, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the warm sepia tones in this picture! Those rich sepia tones alongside the angle of seeing the patrons coming into the restaurant creates a mood that is warm and inviting. Great balance of main elements here. There are three seats on the right that line the front countertop. They act as a leading lines guiding our eye to the front door where three wait to be seated.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the warm sepia tones in this picture! Those rich sepia tones alongside the angle of seeing the patrons coming into the restaurant creates a mood that is warm and inviting. Great balance of main elements here. There are three seats on the right that line the front countertop. They act as a leading lines guiding our eye to the front door where three wait to be seated.', '2018-07-13 23:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
