(7582793, 1219386, 94815, '<td valign="top">Woody images always look too artificial and uninteresting to me. Except this, which gets the all-time best, most imaginative Woody prize. So far, also one of the best images in the challenge.</td>', 'Woody images always look too artificial and uninteresting to me. Except this, which gets the all-time best, most imaginative Woody prize. So far, also one of the best images in the challenge.', '2018-07-16 11:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582822, 1219225, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the light streaming in from the large patio windows that illuminate the indoor pool and the swim team that is getting ready for practice. Lovely light and wonderful details!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the light streaming in from the large patio windows that illuminate the indoor pool and the swim team that is getting ready for practice. Lovely light and wonderful details!', '2018-07-16 11:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582828, 1219417, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Soft dappled light that catches beautifully in the waterdrops. The bokeh circles compliment the glistening dewdrops. The light, color, and focus strongly projects the sense of soft to the touch as one gazes upon this photo.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Soft dappled light that catches beautifully in the waterdrops. The bokeh circles compliment the glistening dewdrops. The light, color, and focus strongly projects the sense of soft to the touch as one gazes upon this photo.', '2018-07-16 11:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582837, 1218163, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love those rays of sunlight bursting out from behind the sun-rimmed clouds above. The light is beautiful upon the clouds. The sun''s rays is what guided me to the silhouetted plane that is flying in the cloud deck. Without those ''leading lines'' I think the plane would be missed as part of the main element in this photo. As it is it still gets a bit lost in all the negative space. One suggestion I have is to tighten up the focus on the composition''s main elements - crop out 1/3 off the right and on the bottom and let the rays of light, the dramatic clouds and the airplane take a more prominent role on stage in this photo.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love those rays of sunlight bursting out from behind the sun-rimmed clouds above. The light is beautiful upon the clouds. The sun''s rays is what guided me to the silhouetted plane that is flying in the cloud deck. Without those ''leading lines'' I think the plane would be missed as part of the main element in this photo. As it is it still gets a bit lost in all the negative space. One suggestion I have is to tighten up the focus on the composition''s main elements - crop out 1/3 off the right and on the bottom and let the rays of light, the dramatic clouds and the airplane take a more prominent role on stage in this photo.', '2018-07-16 11:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582841, 1219373, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Lovely light on this early bird! I like how the light rims the head and the body - outlining the subject like that of studio hair lights. The bokeh backdrop allows the subject to visually pop off of the composition. Great details and fantastic capture of this bird in action gathering twigs in it''s beak for building the nest.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Lovely light on this early bird! I like how the light rims the head and the body - outlining the subject like that of studio hair lights. The bokeh backdrop allows the subject to visually pop off of the composition. Great details and fantastic capture of this bird in action gathering twigs in it''s beak for building the nest.', '2018-07-16 11:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582844, 1219161, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Two together strolling home as the day is done. Love the mood, the shadows on the ground, and feel of this capture! The setting sun heralds the day coming to an end. The warm tones and the close proximity of the couple invokes the story of a day of fun and togetherness - it was a good day. Walking on the curved path towards the setting sun they head home together to rest.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Two together strolling home as the day is done. Love the mood, the shadows on the ground, and feel of this capture! The setting sun heralds the day coming to an end. The warm tones and the close proximity of the couple invokes the story of a day of fun and togetherness - it was a good day. Walking on the curved path towards the setting sun they head home together to rest.', '2018-07-16 11:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582851, 1218465, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Plenty of surrealism and mystery in this photo! This traveler finds himself in a strange land. A ''gate change'' has landed him in unfamiliar territory. Pulling his luggage behind him, silhouetted against the sands, he scans the rolling dunes where there is a spectacular play of light and shadow. Alone in the desert without another soul to be seen, he wanders in search of someone or something familiar. Great light, great mood, and tells a chapter in the story of life''s journey. For we all feel like this stranded traveler at some point in our lives. Well done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Plenty of surrealism and mystery in this photo! This traveler finds himself in a strange land. A ''gate change'' has landed him in unfamiliar territory. Pulling his luggage behind him, silhouetted against the sands, he scans the rolling dunes where there is a spectacular play of light and shadow. Alone in the desert without another soul to be seen, he wanders in search of someone or something familiar. Great light, great mood, and tells a chapter in the story of life''s journey. For we all feel like this stranded traveler at some point in our lives. Well done!', '2018-07-16 12:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582852, 1219135, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The sun is a warm golden globe that beautifully illuminates these lavender flowers.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The sun is a warm golden globe that beautifully illuminates these lavender flowers.', '2018-07-16 12:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582860, 1218820, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Spectacular golden light in this beach scene! The warm tones of gold and orange capture the feel of a summer morning spend on the shore. Love the silhouettes of the lifeguard and the seagull in flight as the day awakens and the ocean waves roll in!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Spectacular golden light in this beach scene! The warm tones of gold and orange capture the feel of a summer morning spend on the shore. Love the silhouettes of the lifeguard and the seagull in flight as the day awakens and the ocean waves roll in!', '2018-07-16 12:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582861, 1219059, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Beautiful glints of the sunset light that illuminate the surface of the water making it appear like glass! The flow of water down the falls is silky smooth. The cascade contrasts beautifully off of the dark rocks that line the river. Beautiful long exposure that captures the beauty of this landscape from the waterfall to the sunset.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Beautiful glints of the sunset light that illuminate the surface of the water making it appear like glass! The flow of water down the falls is silky smooth. The cascade contrasts beautifully off of the dark rocks that line the river. Beautiful long exposure that captures the beauty of this landscape from the waterfall to the sunset.', '2018-07-16 12:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582866, 1219424, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the strong contrasts between light and shadow in this black &amp; white photograph! The glean of light on the brick pavers and the shadows that act as leading lines back to the people strolling on the path. I think ''walks of life'' as I look at this photo. A runner ''disappears'' into the light. While it does ''mask'' the runner''s identity I feel it is as much of guess me if you can as it is also a catch me if you can. I feel the viewer takes an active role in this scene because curiosity of ''who is it'' compels one to run to catch up to the person disappearing into the strong burst of light from the sun.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the strong contrasts between light and shadow in this black & white photograph! The glean of light on the brick pavers and the shadows that act as leading lines back to the people strolling on the path. I think ''walks of life'' as I look at this photo. A runner ''disappears'' into the light. While it does ''mask'' the runner''s identity I feel it is as much of guess me if you can as it is also a catch me if you can. I feel the viewer takes an active role in this scene because curiosity of ''who is it'' compels one to run to catch up to the person disappearing into the strong burst of light from the sun.', '2018-07-16 12:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582940, 1219159, 56502, '<td valign="top">I find the harsh contrast and the leading lines appealing.</td>', 'I find the harsh contrast and the leading lines appealing.', '2018-07-16 16:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582941, 1219153, 56502, '<td valign="top">Joy well captured.</td>', 'Joy well captured.', '2018-07-16 16:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
