(7582944, 1219514, 56502, '<td valign="top">Nice motiv, but her hand unfortunately look very odd compared to the rest of the picture.</td>', 'Nice motiv, but her hand unfortunately look very odd compared to the rest of the picture.', '2018-07-16 16:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582945, 1219438, 56502, '<td valign="top">The dedicated photographer takes shots under any circumstances!</td>', 'The dedicated photographer takes shots under any circumstances!', '2018-07-16 16:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582970, 1219439, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the way the metal railings are lit by the light! The arched bridge railings act as leading lines that draw the viewer to the light off on the horizon. The architectural details on the arches are also very eye catching. The light illuminating the scenery is very lovely but I do wonder if the composition would be stronger or if it would add to the scene if the full or partial orb of the setting sun was captured between the metal arches in the distant point.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the way the metal railings are lit by the light! The arched bridge railings act as leading lines that draw the viewer to the light off on the horizon. The architectural details on the arches are also very eye catching. The light illuminating the scenery is very lovely but I do wonder if the composition would be stronger or if it would add to the scene if the full or partial orb of the setting sun was captured between the metal arches in the distant point.', '2018-07-16 18:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582973, 1218387, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wonderful light and story moment captured in this photo! The silhouette of a farmer stands surveying his field. Chewing on a straw he places his hand on his side - it has been an exhausting, back-breaking day. As the sun sets off in the distance he reflects upon the day and what needs be done on the morrow before heading home to rest.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wonderful light and story moment captured in this photo! The silhouette of a farmer stands surveying his field. Chewing on a straw he places his hand on his side - it has been an exhausting, back-breaking day. As the sun sets off in the distance he reflects upon the day and what needs be done on the morrow before heading home to rest.', '2018-07-16 18:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582976, 1218599, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>First, you have an awesome steampunk/retro dressed couple as the main subjects of the shot! The photo is taken against the light but the sky is blown out and the sun''s glare between the couples heads is more of a distracting element when it could be a contributing element. The sun behind them needs to be a supporting element to the scene - for example taking the shot at a lower angle that the sun is directly behind the left lens on the man''s hat. Composing the sun''s position there would be open up the possibility of a sun starburst pattern radiating from that ''touch''. Another possible placement of the sun is directly behind the woman''s bonnet such that the lace trim will be illuminated with gorgeous light and appear like a halo. Let the sun be an active participant in this portrait of two interesting people dressed in vintage/retro costumes.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. First, you have an awesome steampunk/retro dressed couple as the main subjects of the shot! The photo is taken against the light but the sky is blown out and the sun''s glare between the couples heads is more of a distracting element when it could be a contributing element. The sun behind them needs to be a supporting element to the scene - for example taking the shot at a lower angle that the sun is directly behind the left lens on the man''s hat. Composing the sun''s position there would be open up the possibility of a sun starburst pattern radiating from that ''touch''. Another possible placement of the sun is directly behind the woman''s bonnet such that the lace trim will be illuminated with gorgeous light and appear like a halo. Let the sun be an active participant in this portrait of two interesting people dressed in vintage/retro costumes.', '2018-07-16 19:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582978, 1218522, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I love the gold hues of the setting sun and how it illuminates this wire frame statue of a person playing an instrument! The music of a sunset serenade fills the air. I do have two suggestions on how you can make this composition even stronger. Get lower to the ground and shot at a lower angle looking up at the wire statue if you can. What that would do is make more of the statue appear more prominent in the sky portion of the frame and push the land, buildings and the ocean lower to the ground (at the feet of this statue). The other benefit from getting that low angle is that now you would have the sun level with the head of the statue. Which is in a perfect position to move the angle such that you could you can place the setting sun within the head of the statue.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I love the gold hues of the setting sun and how it illuminates this wire frame statue of a person playing an instrument! The music of a sunset serenade fills the air. I do have two suggestions on how you can make this composition even stronger. Get lower to the ground and shot at a lower angle looking up at the wire statue if you can. What that would do is make more of the statue appear more prominent in the sky portion of the frame and push the land, buildings and the ocean lower to the ground (at the feet of this statue). The other benefit from getting that low angle is that now you would have the sun level with the head of the statue. Which is in a perfect position to move the angle such that you could you can place the setting sun within the head of the statue.', '2018-07-16 19:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
