(7583088, 1218387, 68504, '<td valign="top">what lovely colours you''ve made to happen, what lovely details, but you have ruined the whole thing with that hokey straw in mouth would-be hayseed. I hate to see talent wasted. Maybe spend 5 minutes everyday restraining yourself.</td>', 'what lovely colours you''ve made to happen, what lovely details, but you have ruined the whole thing with that hokey straw in mouth would-be hayseed. I hate to see talent wasted. Maybe spend 5 minutes everyday restraining yourself.', '2018-07-17 01:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
