(7583099, 1219159, 68504, '<td valign="top">I like the watcher who seems to wearing a tent keeping track with her mobile in this most mundane setting. And the tent extended by the shadow. And the mystery of the railing and gate, probably to stairs down, and she just beyond except the illusion that it is a balcony and and the figure is a Spanish duena who has exchanged her fan for a phone. good title.</td>', 'I like the watcher who seems to wearing a tent keeping track with her mobile in this most mundane setting. And the tent extended by the shadow. And the mystery of the railing and gate, probably to stairs down, and she just beyond except the illusion that it is a balcony and and the figure is a Spanish duena who has exchanged her fan for a phone. good title.', '2018-07-17 01:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
