(7583291, 1218265, 67258, '<td valign="top">The only thing that would make this even better for the challenge would be a bit more rim lighting.  Delightful.</td>', 'The only thing that would make this even better for the challenge would be a bit more rim lighting.  Delightful.', '2018-07-17 15:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7583292, 1218499, 67258, '<td valign="top">ReCracking image.</td>', 'ReCracking image.', '2018-07-17 15:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7583293, 1218387, 67258, '<td valign="top">A little too contrived for my tastes, but nonetheless, very competently done.</td>', 'A little too contrived for my tastes, but nonetheless, very competently done.', '2018-07-17 15:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7583306, 1219090, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>There are wonderful contrasts between the light and the shadows in this photo! I like how the fading light illuminates the grass, the water spray/mist, and the person with the outstretched hand. That said, I am left a bit in the dark with what actions I am seeing here because I want to get a closer look. I see the person''s shadow in the frame but I think that the main subjects at the top of the composition are far more interesting. My suggestion is crop to showcase the top half of the frame bringing the viewer closer to the details and story of what is happening there.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. There are wonderful contrasts between the light and the shadows in this photo! I like how the fading light illuminates the grass, the water spray/mist, and the person with the outstretched hand. That said, I am left a bit in the dark with what actions I am seeing here because I want to get a closer look. I see the person''s shadow in the frame but I think that the main subjects at the top of the composition are far more interesting. My suggestion is crop to showcase the top half of the frame bringing the viewer closer to the details and story of what is happening there.', '2018-07-17 16:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7583314, 1218265, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the warm tones throughout this portrait shot! The golden highlights on her hair from the backlighting, the gorgeous bokeh circles, and the warm hues compliment the action/mood going on here of this girl lost in thought. She is daydreaming; the viewer sees it not just in her pose but in the feel/mood of the environment around her.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the warm tones throughout this portrait shot! The golden highlights on her hair from the backlighting, the gorgeous bokeh circles, and the warm hues compliment the action/mood going on here of this girl lost in thought. She is daydreaming; the viewer sees it not just in her pose but in the feel/mood of the environment around her.', '2018-07-17 17:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7583320, 1219054, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the pillar of light that falls on the cobblestone street and the main subject caught within! Deep shadows frame the main subject on either side directing the viewer''s attention to what happens within the path of light. The backlighting illuminates the people in the background just enough that we see there shapes but mostly details remain in the shadows. In the forefront a young child playfully runs. He/she is almost a reflection of the shadow on the ground for most details are hidden because of the strong light. The capture of the the arms outstretched combined with the title transforms a delightful imagery of a child at play into one that is eerie, interesting and strange.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the pillar of light that falls on the cobblestone street and the main subject caught within! Deep shadows frame the main subject on either side directing the viewer''s attention to what happens within the path of light. The backlighting illuminates the people in the background just enough that we see there shapes but mostly details remain in the shadows. In the forefront a young child playfully runs. He/she is almost a reflection of the shadow on the ground for most details are hidden because of the strong light. The capture of the the arms outstretched combined with the title transforms a delightful imagery of a child at play into one that is eerie, interesting and strange.', '2018-07-17 17:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7583325, 1218754, 50864, '<td valign="top">Nice image but I think it would have been really nice without the red.</td>', 'Nice image but I think it would have been really nice without the red.', '2018-07-17 17:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7583330, 1219344, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the light streaming into this coffee shop and the two men lost in thought in the scene! One sits at the table on the left, head resting in hand, coffee mug waiting on the table, lost in thought. The man sitting in the armchair to the right has his hand cupped to his chin lost in thought looking at the paper in his hand. Then there seems to be a third party who is missing. A tray with a coffee mug and creamer sits on the tabletop in the forefront as if we/the viewer are just now returning to the table. I really love how this is just a slice of life with the muted duotones strengthening the contemplative mood captured here! I have to admit I don'' quite get how the title connects to the imagery unless that is the name of the cafe...given that my first thoughts on seeing the image was, lost in thought, give pause (for thought), and on second thought (because of the two men lost in thought)</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the light streaming into this coffee shop and the two men lost in thought in the scene! One sits at the table on the left, head resting in hand, coffee mug waiting on the table, lost in thought. The man sitting in the armchair to the right has his hand cupped to his chin lost in thought looking at the paper in his hand. Then there seems to be a third party who is missing. A tray with a coffee mug and creamer sits on the tabletop in the forefront as if we/the viewer are just now returning to the table. I really love how this is just a slice of life with the muted duotones strengthening the contemplative mood captured here! I have to admit I don'' quite get how the title connects to the imagery unless that is the name of the cafe...given that my first thoughts on seeing the image was, lost in thought, give pause (for thought), and on second thought (because of the two men lost in thought)', '2018-07-17 17:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
