(7583339, 1219462, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love this nighttime scene showing a gathering of people at an outdoor event! Their shapes are contrasted against the lighted building and the light falls on the dark water illuminating the ripples on the surface. My one critique is that I think there is too much negative space that lessens the visual impact of the people gathering and the light reflected on the water''s surface. My suggestion is to crop 1/4 off the bottom and a little off the top to give it a more widescreen look; giving the photo the feel of a scene in a move and bringing the viewer a bit closer to the gala/social.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love this nighttime scene showing a gathering of people at an outdoor event! Their shapes are contrasted against the lighted building and the light falls on the dark water illuminating the ripples on the surface. My one critique is that I think there is too much negative space that lessens the visual impact of the people gathering and the light reflected on the water''s surface. My suggestion is to crop 1/4 off the bottom and a little off the top to give it a more widescreen look; giving the photo the feel of a scene in a move and bringing the viewer a bit closer to the gala/social.', '2018-07-17 17:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
