(7584276, 1218475, 9821, '<td valign="top">My buddy''s parents have a framed photo of the back of their three boys with their pants 1/2 down peeing off the side of a cliff on the side of the road. It''s far better than any posed photo of the three boys because it''s just an honest slice of real life. It''s a timeless classic, in my opinion. This image gives me that same sense of real life discovery of the world. You were robbed ... this image is near perfect, you should be very proud of it. I was your 9 vote. Frame it. (Unless you don''t know these kids, then the magic is slightly lost :)</td>', 'My buddy''s parents have a framed photo of the back of their three boys with their pants 1/2 down peeing off the side of a cliff on the side of the road. It''s far better than any posed photo of the three boys because it''s just an honest slice of real life. It''s a timeless classic, in my opinion. This image gives me that same sense of real life discovery of the world. You were robbed ... this image is near perfect, you should be very proud of it. I was your 9 vote. Frame it. (Unless you don''t know these kids, then the magic is slightly lost :)', '2018-07-20 09:29:26.000000', NULL, 0),
